# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Restart the dev server after changing.

# Google Maps API key for the Street View window.
# - Enable the "Maps JavaScript API" on the key's Google Cloud project (billing on).
# - Restrict the key to your origins (http://localhost:5176 for dev, plus your deploy domain).
# Use YOUR OWN key (this is a private project — don't reuse the NFI/CityPulse key).
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
